  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St Alberts Integrated Livelihoods, Child Protection and GBV project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sr Alberts Mission Hospital works in the remote part of Mashonaland Central and also under the Diocese of Chinhoyi under the Catholic Church ZCBC in Zimbabwe. In an effort to address the impact of poverty in the District St Alberts through the CHBC programme seeks to implement 2 complimentary projects namely the Integrated Livelihoods, Child Protection and Gender based Violence response project as well as responding to challenges young mothers encounter in accessing health delivery services especially for the prevention of cervical cancer, while ensuring that the teen mothers enjoy good mental health. The community based intervention seeks to build resilient and gender just communities in selected wards of Muzarabani District.</narrative>
  </description>
